{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a mysterious tournament, where the winner is granted their heart's desire.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you defeat the nefarious Lord Blackthorn?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you ever discover the secrets of Fardea Island?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what's with all the squirrels?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hands of the Sovereign is a card-based strategy game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crown your Ruler at the start of each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rulers are powerful, but players who lose their Rulers, lose the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your energy to play Creatures, Spells, Traps &amp; Terrains on the field.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble a powerful deck to defeat all your rivals and reach one of multiple endings!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect more than 1000 cards from a variety of themes such as:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casino, Fairytale, Fossil, Medieval, Painting, School, Wild West, Zoo,\u00a0Up On The Rooftop</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...and many, many, many more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665560/extras/Radio-smaller.png?t=1758989552\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665560/extras/Catfiddler-smaller.png?t=1758989552\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet rivals to influence your story's end:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665560/extras/poshnorman.png?t=1758989552\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s